        <h2 className="text-6xl font-black text-ableYellow tracking-tighter">ABILITY CIRCLE.</h2>
        <p className="text-2xl font-bold text-white/60 max-w-3xl">
          Your personal network of loved ones and professional guides, all synced to your unique pace.
